{"suttaId":"sn22.147","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[850,850],"vripara":"147"},"segments":{"sn22.147:0.3":"Aniccānupassīsuttaṃ","sn22.147:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn22.147:1.2":"“Saddhāpabbajitassa, bhikkhave, kulaputtassa ayamanudhammo hoti – yaṃ rūpe aniccānupassī vihareyya.","sn22.147:1.4":"Vedanāya … saññāya … saṅkhāresu … viññāṇe aniccānupassī vihareyya … pe …‘parimuccati dukkhasmā’ti vadāmī”ti.","sn22.147:1.9":"Dvādasamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":391,"to":394,"paras":[{"para":391,"vripara":"136-149","refs":["sn22.147:1"],"lines":["136-149. Kukkuḷavaggassa paṭhame <b>kukkuḷan</b>ti santattaṃ ādittaṃ chārikarāsiṃ viya mahāpariḷāhaṃ.","Imasmiṃ sutte dukkhalakkhaṇaṃ kathitaṃ, sesesu aniccalakkhaṇādīni.","Sabbāni cetāni pāṭiyekkaṃ puggalajjhāsayena kathitānīti."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.147:1"],["sn22.147:1"],["sn22.147:1"]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo cuddasamo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Diṭṭhivaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":394,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.147:1"],"lines":["1-9. Ajjhattasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.147:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":395,"to":399,"paras":[{"para":395,"vripara":"136-149","refs":["sn22.147:1"],"lines":["136-149. Anto aggi mahanto chārikarāsi, tattha ukkuḷavikulato akkamantaṃ yāva kesaggaṃ anudahatāya kucchitaṃ kuḷanti kukkuḷaṃ, rūpavedanādi pana tatopi kañci kālaṃ anudahanato mahāpariḷāhanaṭṭhena ca kukkuḷaṃ viyāti <b>kukkuḷaṃ.</b>","<b>Aniccalakkhaṇādīnī</b>ti aniccadukkhānattalakkhaṇāni."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.147:1"],["sn22.147:1"]]},{"para":396,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":397,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":398,"vripar